=== Year-month INTERVAL multiplication preserves structure ===
SELECT INTERVAL '1 year' * 2 AS yr2;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'AS yr2' at line 1
SELECT INTERVAL '1 year 6 months' * 2 AS yr1mo6x2;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'AS yr1mo6x2' at line 1
=== DATE + INTERVAL across year/month boundaries ===
SELECT DATE '2024-12-31' + INTERVAL '1 day' AS new_year;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'AS new_year' at line 1
