ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'AS next_jan' at line 1
=== Leap-day handling — clamps to last valid day ===
SELECT DATE '2024-02-29' + INTERVAL '1 year' AS leap_to_nonleap;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'AS leap_to_nonleap' at line 1
